research/subjects-01-dispatch/scaffolder-monoidal-abelian-categories.result.json:16:  "tail": "Completed the [category-theory prose scaffold](/Users/ianx/Projects/prestige-math-library/research/plan-category-theory-track.md:1).\n\n- 18 A/B pairs, 36 pages.\n- 704 A-page and 140 companion items.\n- Every A page ≤60 items, with no numbering gaps.\n- No duplicate proposed IDs, published-ID collisions, or unresolved forward references.\n- Full canonical harvest includes [Riehl](https://emilyriehl.github.io/files/context.pdf), [Leinster](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1612.09375), [Kelly](https://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/reprints/articles/10/tr10.pdf), [Freyd](https://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/reprints/articles/3/tr3.pdf), and [EGNO](https://math.mit.edu/~etingof/egnobookfinal.pdf), plus the recorded lecture-note and primary-source corpus.\n- Choice-strength, well-definedness, provenance, seams, scope denials, amendments, and the closed continuity checkpoint are included.\n- Kelly’s inaccessible 1964 coherence paper is recorded as the sole contained blocker, with alternative sourced routes.\n- Only the owned scaffold was edited. No build artifacts, items, spec changes, gates, or publishing actions were performed."
