research/audit/wave12-coverage.json:556:  "attestation": "Audit-Alpha recovered the complete durable Wave 12 record and read all 61 scoped items, all four page files, all 48 proof contracts, all 889 A6 relationships, all 152 exact outside targets, all 364 A6 impact consumers, and all 59 proof-bearing top-100 spine items without sampling. A6 reconciled the frozen 29-edge Wave12-to-Wave11 barrier, certified all 39 repair/source targets, and closed the generated-statement cone. A7 paired exactly those 39 targets. A8 adjudicated every rejection, repaired only three confirmed-fatal items, independently recertified them, and read all 65 affected consumers. A9 reread all 39 repair/source targets and all four pages, corrected eight item interfaces plus one page summary, read all 144 affected consumers in full, obtained nine exact-final Terra certifications, and paired exactly the eight changed items. The final repair-target receipt contains 43 ids, all 44 exact rejection candidates are adjudicated, contracts pass 48/48, the final manifest contains 890 exact relationships, and the formal A9 impact audit passes with zero errors or warnings."
